Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.35,0:00:10.75,TL,,0,0,0,,首盘她拖到{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}才拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.75,0:00:11.91,TL,,0,0,0,,可最后{\fs78}9{\fs68}局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.91,0:00:13.96,TL,,0,0,0,,贝莱克只赢了一局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.25,0:00:20.07,TL,,0,0,0,,北京时间{\fs78}8{\fs68}月{\fs78}23{\fs68}日早上 快{\fs78}8{\fs68}点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.07,0:00:22.33,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}WTA1000{\fs68}辛辛那提半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.33,0:00:23.50,TL,,0,0,0,,贝莱克对高芙
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.50,0:00:25.43,TL,,0,0,0,,两人生涯第一次交手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.25,0:00:31.53,TL,,0,0,0,,贝莱克是这一站最大的黑马
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.53,0:00:33.94,TL,,0,0,0,,非种子的她连过普利斯科娃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.94,0:00:34.85,TL,,0,0,0,,萨巴伦卡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.85,0:00:37.25,TL,,0,0,0,,凯斯和克雷奇科娃{\fs78}4{\fs68}位名将
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.25,0:00:39.70,TL,,0,0,0,,一路杀进半决赛 今天
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.70,0:00:41.73,TL,,0,0,0,,她第一次撞上了高芙
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.63,0:00:55.21,TL,,0,0,0,,首盘她不是没机会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.21,0:00:56.96,TL,,0,0,0,,贝莱克顶住过破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.96,0:00:58.55,TL,,0,0,0,,比分一路拉锯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.68,0:01:05.72,TL,,0,0,1240,,{\fs46}Coco can celebrate the first set.{\fs68}\N科科可以为这一盘庆祝了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.72,0:01:07.88,TL,,0,0,1240,,{\fs46}One like that certainly had to work{\fs68}\N这一盘她要费更大力气
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.88,0:01:10.88,TL,,0,0,1240,,{\fs46}a lot harder for it in the latter stages{\fs68}\N才能在后半段拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.88,0:01:14.28,TL,,0,0,1240,,{\fs46}as Bejlek brought some of her very best to bear.{\fs68}\N贝莱克拿出了她最好的表现
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.28,0:01:16.80,TL,,0,0,1240,,{\fs46}The American pips her to it, 6 比 4.{\fs68}\N这位美国人以六比四险胜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.85,0:01:19.18,TL,,0,0,0,,次盘 高芙的一发一分没丢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.18,0:01:21.75,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}次一发得分 全部拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.75,0:01:22.74,TL,,0,0,0,,贝莱克这边
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.74,0:01:23.88,TL,,0,0,0,,一发再落地
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:25.94,TL,,0,0,0,,也一分没能接回来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.84,0:01:57.96,TL,,0,0,1240,,{\fs46}Coco Gauff is back in the final in Cincinnati.{\fs68}\N高芙重新杀回了辛辛那提决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.96,0:02:00.52,TL,,0,0,1240,,{\fs46}Champion 3 years ago.{\fs68}\N三年前她在这里夺过冠
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.52,0:02:06.40,TL,,0,0,1240,,{\fs46}She brings to an end a brilliant week by Sara Bejlek.{\fs68}\N她终结了贝莱克这精彩的一周
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.40,0:02:10.08,TL,,0,0,1240,,{\fs46}So many great names that she has taken out,{\fs68}\N淘汰了这么多响亮的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.08,0:02:15.36,TL,,0,0,1240,,{\fs46}but Gauff was having none of it tonight.{\fs68}\N可高芙今晚不给她机会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.36,0:02:19.88,TL,,0,0,1240,,{\fs46}Took charge early, fended off the fight back well enough,{\fs68}\N她早早掌控局面，稳稳挡住反扑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.88,0:02:22.16,TL,,0,0,1240,,{\fs46}and then stormed to the finish line{\fs68}\N然后一路冲向终点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.16,0:02:25.72,TL,,0,0,1240,,{\fs46}and is deservedly into her eighth WTA 1000 final{\fs68}\N闯进生涯第八个{\fs78}1000{\fs68}赛决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.72,0:02:28.80,TL,,0,0,1240,,{\fs46}in her career and her third of the year.{\fs68}\N也是本季第三个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.80,0:02:32.06,TL,,0,0,1240,,{\fs46}Will this be the one that she finally gets to win?{\fs68}\N这一次，她能拿下吗？
